ENTRY 12129 {"id":12129,"kind":"pi.tool-result","messages":[{"role":"toolResult","text":"./tests/e2e/run-phase4c.sh:11:#   restart-skip  after an orchestrator restart the clone is found and skipped (log `workspace-present`, no\n./tests/e2e/run-phase4c.sh:12:#                 `workspace-cloned`), and a file the agent wrote in the clone is still there\n./tests/e2e/run-phase4c.sh:188:  assert_eq \"the orchestrator logged one clone\" 1 \"$(orch_log | grep -c \"\\\"event\\\":\\\"workspace-cloned\\\".*$id\")\"\n./tests/e2e/run-phase4c.sh:222:  assert_eq \"the clone was found and skipped\" 1 \"$(orch_log | grep -c \"\\\"event\\\":\\\"workspace-present\\\".*$repo_session\")\"\n./tests/e2e/run-phase4c.sh:223:  assert_eq \"no second clone after the restart\" 0 \"$(orch_log | grep -c \"\\\"event\\\":\\\"workspace-cloned\\\".*$repo_session\" || true)\"\n./packages/orchestrator/src/repo-access.ts:243:    // `workspace-cloned` once per session; `workspace-present` after a restart. tests/e2e/run-phase4c.sh greps both.\n./packages/orchestrator/src/repo-access.ts:244:    log(outcome === \"cloned\" ? \"workspace-cloned\" : \"workspace-present\", {\n<harness>\n[info] Full output: /tmp/tmp-EiAhgi/pi-output-4237fe87-6ba0-4ea4-bfe8-925d169ea495.log\n[warn] Output truncated to its end: 119 lines, 78169 bytes dropped\n</harness>","isError":false}]}
